{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21995","headline":"秦中吟十首 议婚 · 白居易","name":"秦中吟十首 议婚","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"天下无正声，悦耳即爲娱。\n人间无正色，悦目即爲姝。\n颜色非相远，贫富则有殊。\n贫爲时所弃，富爲时所趋。\n红楼富家女，金缕绣罗襦。\n见人不敛手，娇痴二八初。\n母兄未开口，已嫁不须臾。\n绿窗贫家女，寂莫二十余。\n荆钗不直钱，衣上无真珠。\n几回人欲聘，临日又踟蹰。\n主人会良媒，置酒满玉壶。\n四座且勿饮，听我歌两途。\n富家女易嫁，嫁早轻其夫。\n贫家女难嫁，嫁晚孝於姑。\n闻君欲娶妇，娶妇意何如。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21995.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21995","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}